@startuml
left to right direction
actor "Fleet Operator" as Operator
actor "Operations Engineer" as Ops
rectangle "Vehicle Simulator" as Simulator
rectangle "Fleet Dashboard" as Dashboard
rectangle "Piattaforma FleetPulse" as FleetPulse
rectangle "Grafana" as Grafana
Operator --> Dashboard : Funzioni operative
Dashboard --> FleetPulse : REST HTTP/JSON verso Fleet API
Simulator --> FleetPulse : Telemetria sintetica via TCP
Ops --> Grafana : Observability tecnica
Grafana --> FleetPulse : Query metriche tramite Prometheus
@enduml
